<title>USA: Continental to buy rest of Air Micronesia.</title>
<headline>Continental to buy rest of Air Micronesia.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said it signed a letter of intent to buy the nine percent stake of Air Micronesia Inc owned by United Micronesia Development Association Inc for $73 million.</p>
<p>Continental owns the majority stake of the Air Micronesia subsidiary. The unit provides service in the western Pacific from its Guam hub.</p>
